<p>Your privacy matters to us. This policy explains what information GreenNest collects, how we use it and the choices you have.</p>
<h2>Information we collect</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Account details</strong> — your name, email address, phone number and an encrypted password when you create an account.</li>
  <li><strong>Order details</strong> — delivery address, contact information and the items you purchase.</li>
  <li><strong>Messages</strong> — anything you send us through our contact form.</li>
  <li><strong>Newsletter</strong> — your email address if you subscribe.</li>
</ul>
<h2>How we use it</h2>
<p>We use your information only to process and deliver orders, provide customer support, send newsletters you have opted into, and improve our service. We never sell your personal data.</p>
<h2>Cookies</h2>
<p>We use a single essential session cookie to keep you signed in and remember your cart. We do not use advertising or tracking cookies.</p>
<h2>Data security</h2>
<p>Passwords are stored using strong one-way hashing, and access to customer data is limited to authorised staff.</p>
<h2>Your rights</h2>
<p>You can update your profile at any time from your account, unsubscribe from emails, or contact us to request a copy or deletion of your data.</p>
